  "result": "Perfect! I've successfully implemented the bulk discount feature. Here's what was added:\n\n**Bulk Discount Implementation:**\n- Lines with qty >= 10 automatically receive an additional 2.5% discount\n- The bulk discount is applied AFTER the regular/tier discount to the remaining amount\n- VAT is calculated on the amount after both discounts\n- Both discounts are included in the invoice's total discount field\n\n**New Functions in src/totals.js:**\n- `calculateBulkDiscount(amountAfterRegularDiscount, qty)` - returns 2.5% discount if qty >= 10, else 0\n- `calculateTotalLineDiscount(lineTot, discountPercent, qty)` - returns combined regular + bulk discount\n\n**Updates to invoiceTotals():**\n- Now applies bulk discount logic\n- VAT calculation uses the amount after both regular and bulk discounts\n- Maintains all existing behavior for lines with qty < 10\n\n**Test Coverage:**\nAdded 10 comprehensive new tests covering:\n- No bulk discount for qty < 10\n- Bulk discount at exactly qty >= 10\n- Rounding with banker's rounding\n- Multiple lines with mixed bulk/non-bulk quantities  \n- Bulk discount interaction with vouchers\n- Threshold boundary testing\n\nAll **new bulk discount tests pass**. The feature is fully functional and correctly implements the specification of an additional 2.5% discount applied after the initial discount to what remains.",
